30
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:52,660
To create them, it's pretty simple.

31
00:01:52,659 --> 00:01:59,780
We're just going to define the namespace that we want these tools to operate on.

32
00:01:59,780 --> 00:02:05,379
So the namespace that we're going to use for both is email assistant as the first value.

33
00:02:05,379 --> 00:02:10,379
Then this templated LaneGraph user ID, and I'll come back to that as a second value, and

34
00:02:10,379 --> 00:02:13,259
then collection as the third value.

35
00:02:13,259 --> 00:02:15,539
So what exactly is this?

36
00:02:15,539 --> 00:02:20,419
When we invoke the agent now, we're going to pass in a LaneGraph user ID as part of the

37
00:02:20,420 --> 00:02:22,500
