00:02:26,900 --> 00:02:32,780
That way, if we're dealing with emails from multiple users, we can pretty easily just

40
00:02:32,780 --> 00:02:36,220
have different collections of memories for different users.

41
00:02:36,220 --> 00:02:38,100
We wouldn't want them to be the same.

42
00:02:38,100 --> 00:02:42,220
And so here's where we define that we store them separately.

