00:03:15,060 --> 00:03:18,259
We can also take a look at the arguments to this tool.

53
00:03:18,259 --> 00:03:24,819
We can see that it takes in content, then an action, so the action can be create, update,

54
00:03:24,819 --> 00:03:27,659
